# @visif/form-builder

Publishable React 18 library. Source: `src/` → `dist/` via `yarn build`.

## Layers

- `src/components/builder/` — designer (ReactFormBuilder)
- `src/components/generator/` — renderer (ReactFormGenerator)
- `src/components/form-elements/` — shared fields

State: FormBuilderContext + FormContext. Form values via FormContext only.

## Tooling

- Yarn v1 (not npm install)
- `yarn dev` / `yarn build` / `yarn link:local` / `yarn lint` / `yarn test`
- migration-vdc local dev: see `docs/LOCAL_DEV_CONSUMER.md` (label lives in parent app, not library)
- Peers: react, react-dom >= 18 (externalized in Vite build)

## Do not

- Reintroduce class components or ref-based form value collection
- Pin react/react-dom as direct dependencies in library code
- Edit `dist/` by hand or add unrelated docs/commits
